{"id":"wb-8-270","name":"常州唐氏民宅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"唐荆川宅","text":"唐荆川宅，位于江苏省常州市天宁区青果巷，原有筠星堂、贞和堂、易书堂、四并堂、八桂堂、复始堂、松健堂、礼和堂，合称“唐氏八宅”，始建于明弘治、正德年间。现存贞和堂、筠星堂、八桂堂、礼和堂、松健堂，于1982年3月25日以“唐荆川宅”的名称公布为第三批江苏省文物保护单位。2019年10月7日，贞和堂、礼和堂以“常州唐氏民宅”的名称公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。贞和堂已辟为唐荆川纪念馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%94%90%E8%8D%86%E5%B7%9D%E5%AE%85","revisionId":94567545,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94567545","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bf450d517184a93fccb52874.jpg","title":"Tang's_Residences,_Changzhou_(Lihetang).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tang%27s_Residences,_Changzhou_(Lihetang).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/Tang%27s_Residences%2C_Changzhou_%28Lihetang%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Vesekskiy","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​常州唐氏民宅（礼和堂）","width":320,"height":240}}